<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>이든배움국어학원</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/home.css">
    <%- include('../partials/header-styles') %>
    <style>
        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            background-color: white;
            color: #333;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .section {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            position: relative;
            padding: 80px 20px;
        }

        .intro-section {
            background-color: white;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .intro-logo {
            max-width: 300px;
            height: auto;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(50px);
            animation: fadeInUp 1s ease-out 0.5s forwards;
        }

        .intro-text {
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 300;
            line-height: 1.4;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(50px);
            animation: fadeInUp 1s ease-out 0.5s forwards;
        }

        .scroll-arrow {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 50px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            cursor: pointer;
            animation: bounce 2s infinite;
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: #007bff;
        }

        .content-section {
            flex-direction: column;
            padding: 100px 20px;
        }

        .section-image {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(50px);
            transition: all 0.8s ease-out;
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            margin: 20px 0;
            position: relative;
        }

        .section-text {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 300;
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 1.4;
            margin: 40px 0;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(50px);
            transition: all 0.8s ease-out;
        }

        .chalkboard-text {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(0.8);
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: white;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
            opacity: 0;
            transition: all 0.8s ease-out;
            z-index: 10;
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }

        .teacher-info {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 400px;
            text-align: left;
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
            transition: all 0.8s ease-out;
        }

        .teachers-container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .teacher-row {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: row;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 80px 60px;
            margin: 0;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(50px);
            transition: all 0.8s ease-out;
            gap: 80px;
        }

        .teacher-row.reverse {
            flex-direction: row-reverse;
        }

        .teacher-photo {
            width: 400px;
            height: 600px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .teacher-photo img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .teacher-info {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 400px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .teacher-row.reverse .teacher-info {
            text-align: right;
        }

        .teacher-school {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .teacher-name {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: #666;
        }

        .animate {
            opacity: 1 !important;
            transform: translateY(0) translateX(0) scale(1) !important;
        }

        .scroll-reveal {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(50px);
            transition: all 0.8s ease-out;
        }

        .scroll-reveal.animate {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .stagger-animation {
            transition-delay: 0s;
        }

        .stagger-animation:nth-child(1) { transition-delay: 0.1s; }
        .stagger-animation:nth-child(2) { transition-delay: 0.2s; }
        .stagger-animation:nth-child(3) { transition-delay: 0.3s; }
        .stagger-animation:nth-child(4) { transition-delay: 0.4s; }
        .stagger-animation:nth-child(5) { transition-delay: 0.5s; }
        .stagger-animation:nth-child(6) { transition-delay: 0.6s; }
        .stagger-animation:nth-child(7) { transition-delay: 0.7s; }
        .stagger-animation:nth-child(8) { transition-delay: 0.8s; }
        .stagger-animation:nth-child(9) { transition-delay: 0.9s; }

        @keyframes fadeInUp {
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        @keyframes bounce {
            0%, 20%, 50%, 80%, 100% {
                transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0);
            }
            40% {
                transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-10px);
            }
            60% {
                transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-5px);
            }
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(50px);
            transition: all 0.8s ease-out;
        }

        .section-title h2 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .section-description {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #666;
        }

        .teachers-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 2px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(50px);
            transition: all 0.8s ease-out;
        }

        .teacher-card {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(30px) scale(0.95);
            transition: all 0.6s ease-out;
        }

        .teacher-image {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            aspect-ratio: 3/4;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .teacher-image img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
            image-rendering: optimizeSpeed;
            image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;
            image-rendering: optimize-contrast;
            backface-visibility: hidden;
            transform: translateZ(0);
        }

        .teacher-card:hover .teacher-image img {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .teacher-label {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(0,0,0,0.8));
            color: white;
            padding: 30px 20px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .school-name {
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .school-name-large {
            font-size: 1.87rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .teacher-name {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: normal;
            color: white;
        }

        .greeting-section {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 80px 40px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            gap: 60px;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(50px);
            transition: all 0.8s ease-out;
        }

        .greeting-image {
            flex: 1.3;
            max-width: 650px;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateX(-50px);
            transition: all 0.8s ease-out 0.2s;
        }

        .greeting-image img {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }

        .greeting-content {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 550px;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateX(50px);
            transition: all 0.8s ease-out 0.4s;
        }

        .greeting-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .greeting-text {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #555;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .greeting-philosophy {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            border-left: 4px solid #007bff;
        }

        .greeting-philosophy h3 {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .greeting-philosophy p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #555;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .system-links {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .system-link {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background-color: #007bff;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 25px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: center;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .system-link:hover {
            background-color: #0056b3;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0,123,255,0.3);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .nav {
                flex-wrap: wrap;
                padding: 10px;
            }

            .nav-item {
                margin: 5px 10px;
                font-size: 14px;
            }

            .intro-text {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }

            .section-text {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }

            .section-title h2 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }

            .section-description {
                font-size: 1.2rem;
                padding: 0 20px;
            }

            .teachers-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 20px;
                padding: 0 20px;
            }


            .teacher-label {
                font-size: 1.2rem;
                padding: 20px;
            }

            .school-name-large {
                font-size: 1.33rem;
                margin-bottom: 6px;
            }

            .teacher-name {
                font-size: 1.2rem;
                font-weight: normal;
                color: white;
            }

            .teachers-container {
                padding: 20px 10px;
            }

            .teacher-row {
                flex-direction: column !important;
                gap: 40px;
                padding: 80px 20px;
            }

            .teacher-row.reverse {
                flex-direction: column !important;
            }

            .teacher-photo {
                width: 90%;
                max-width: 300px;
                height: 450px;
            }

            .teacher-info {
                text-align: center !important;
                max-width: none;
            }

            .teacher-row.reverse .teacher-info {
                text-align: center !important;
            }

            .teacher-school {
                font-size: 1.5rem;
            }

            .teacher-name {
                font-size: 1.2rem;
            }

            .chalkboard-text {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }

            .greeting-section {
                flex-direction: column;
                padding: 60px 20px;
                gap: 40px;
            }

            .greeting-image {
                max-width: 100%;
            }

            .greeting-content {
                max-width: 100%;
            }

            .greeting-title {
                font-size: 1.5rem;
            }

            .greeting-text {
                font-size: 1rem;
            }

            .greeting-philosophy {
                padding: 20px;
            }

            .greeting-philosophy h3 {
                font-size: 1.1rem;
            }

            .greeting-philosophy p {
                font-size: 1rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('../partials/header') %>

    <section id="intro" class="section intro-section">
        <div>
            <img src="/image/logo.png" alt="이든배움국어학원 로고" class="intro-logo">
            <h1 class="intro-text">오직 너희 학교에만 집중하는<br>국어 전문선생님과 함께</h1>
            <div class="scroll-arrow" onclick="scrollToNext()">
                ⬇
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 인사말 섹션 -->
    <section class="section">
        <div class="greeting-section">
            <div class="greeting-image">
                <img src="/image/서효정 대표원장.jpg" alt="서효정 대표원장" loading="lazy">
            </div>
            <div class="greeting-content">
                <h2 class="greeting-title">대표원장 인사말</h2>
                <div class="greeting-text">
                    안녕하세요. 이든배움국어학원 서효정 대표원장입니다.<br>
                    이든은 순우리말로, '참된, 어진' 이란 의미를 담고 있습니다.<br>
                    상동 지역 학생들에게 참되고 선하게, 올바른 방법으로 국어를 가르치겠다는 일념으로 학원을 개원한지 어느덧 15년이라는 시간이 흘렀습니다.
                </div>
                <div class="greeting-philosophy">
                    <h3>이든배움국어학원은<br>'본질에 충실한 가르침'을<br>교육철학으로 정하고,</h3>
                    <p>교육철학이 담긴 시스템을 만들기 위해<br>끊임없이 연구합니다.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="greeting-text">
                    초중고 환경에 맞는<br>
                    국어 학습 시스템을 통해<br>
                    상동지역 학생들의 국어 역량강화를 위해<br>
                    더욱 노력하겠습니다.
                </div>
                <div class="system-links">
                    <a href="#" class="system-link" data-target="reading">독서교육원 시스템 보기</a>
                    <a href="#" class="system-link" data-target="middle-school">중등부 시스템 보기</a>
                    <a href="#" class="system-link" data-target="high-school">고등부 시스템 보기</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 고등부 섹션 -->
    <section id="high-school" class="section content-section">
        <div class="section-title">
            <h2>이든국어 고등부</h2>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: bold; color: #007bff; margin-bottom: 20px;">‘성과를 내기 위한 시스템’</h3>
            <p class="section-description">
                고등부에서 가장 중요한 것은 ‘성과’입니다.<br>
                최고의 국어 전문가들이<br>
                학생들에게 집중할 수 있는 환경을 제공하기 위해,<br>
                학교별 전문가를 배정하고,<br>
                수년간 해당 학교에만 집중하는 환경을 제공하여,<br>
                수업과 클리닉, 자료에서 학교별 전문성을 더욱 강화하였습니다.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="teachers-grid">
            <div class="teacher-card">
                <div class="teacher-image">
                    <img src="/image/김보름 선생님.jpg" alt="김보름 선생님" loading="lazy">
                    <div class="teacher-label">
                        <span class="school-name-large">상원고</span>
                        <span class="teacher-name">김보름 선생님</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="teacher-card">
                <div class="teacher-image">
                    <img src="/image/이창완 선생님.jpg" alt="이창완 선생님" loading="lazy">
                    <div class="teacher-label">
                        <span class="school-name-large">상동고</span>
                        <span class="teacher-name">이창완 선생님</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="teacher-card">
                <div class="teacher-image">
                    <img src="/image/이우용 선생님.jpg" alt="이우용 선생님" loading="lazy">
                    <div class="teacher-label">
                        <span class="school-name-large">송내고</span>
                        <span class="teacher-name">이우용 선생님</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="teacher-card">
                <div class="teacher-image">
                    <img src="/image/박옥선 선생님.jpg" alt="박옥선 선생님" loading="lazy">
                    <div class="teacher-label">
                        <span class="school-name-large">부명고</span>
                        <span class="teacher-name">박옥선 선생님</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="teacher-card">
                <div class="teacher-image">
                    <img src="/image/박정영 선생님.jpg" alt="박정영 선생님" loading="lazy">
                    <div class="teacher-label">
                        <span class="school-name-large">정명, 부천여고</span>
                        <span class="teacher-name">박정영 선생님</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="teacher-card">
                <div class="teacher-image">
                    <img src="/image/권지영 선생님.jpg" alt="권지영 선생님" loading="lazy">
                    <div class="teacher-label">
                        <span class="school-name-large">상일고</span>
                        <span class="teacher-name">권지영 선생님</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="teacher-card">
                <div class="teacher-image">
                    <img src="/image/김소솜 선생님.jpg" alt="김소솜 선생님" loading="lazy">
                    <div class="teacher-label">
                        <span class="school-name-large">중원, 중흥고</span>
                        <span class="teacher-name">김소솜 선생님</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="teacher-card">
                <div class="teacher-image">
                    <img src="/image/백슬기 선생님.jpg" alt="백슬기 선생님" loading="lazy">
                    <div class="teacher-label">
                        <span class="school-name-large">소명여고</span>
                        <span class="teacher-name">백슬기 선생님</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="teacher-card">
                <div class="teacher-image">
                    <img src="/image/라영서 선생님.jpg" alt="라영서 선생님" loading="lazy">
                    <div class="teacher-label">
                        <span class="school-name-large">수능국어</span>
                        <span class="teacher-name">라영서 선생님</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 중등부 섹션 -->
    <section id="middle-school" class="section content-section">
        <div class="section-title">
            <h2>이든국어 중등부</h2>
            <h3 style="font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: bold; color: #007bff; margin-bottom: 20px;">'교과국어와 심화독서의 조화'</h3>
            <p class="section-description">
                고등국어 준비와 내신대비수업에 최적화된<br>
                교과국어학습 프로그램과<br>
                학생들의 사고력과 문해력, 글쓰기 역량을 더욱 강화시켜주는<br>
                심화독서 프로그램으로,<br>
                중등국어에 최적화된 환경을 제공합니다.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="teachers-grid">
            <div class="teacher-card">
                <div class="teacher-image">
                    <img src="/image/김태경 선생님.jpg" alt="김태경 선생님" loading="lazy">
                    <div class="teacher-label">
                        <span class="school-name-large">상일중, 고입담당</span>
                        <span class="teacher-name">김태경 선생님</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="teacher-card">
                <div class="teacher-image">
                    <img src="/image/심미숙 선생님.jpg" alt="심미숙 선생님" loading="lazy">
                    <div class="teacher-label">
                        <span class="school-name-large">석천중, 고입담당</span>
                        <span class="teacher-name">심미숙 선생님</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="teacher-card">
                <div class="teacher-image">
                    <img src="/image/박서연 선생님.jpg" alt="박서연 선생님" loading="lazy">
                    <div class="teacher-label">
                        <span class="school-name-large">중등 종합반</span>
                        <span class="teacher-name">박서연 선생님</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 독서교육원 섹션 -->
    <section id="reading" class="section content-section">
        <div class="section-title">
            <h2>이든국어 독서교육원</h2>
